# TASK-205 Q1: interim module overlay (scripts/interim-module-overlay.mjs). The in-process half of
# every enabled module lives ONCE, under modules/<id>/app/**; the overlay copies it onto src/** so
# SvelteKit can route it. These are build outputs, never committed (one source file, TRD-411).
# The overlay test asserts that every destination of every enabled module is matched here
# (git check-ignore), so a new module file outside these patterns fails loudly instead of showing
# up in `git status`. TASK-125 deletes the overlay and this block with it.
/.module-overlay.json
